### =============================================
### ASR 语音识别测试（远程服务器）
### =============================================

### 语音识别 - 上传音频文件
POST http://119.91.206.195:8885/api/asr/recognize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello_world_female2.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./hello_world_female2.wav
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

zh
--WebAppBoundary--

### 语音识别 - 英文音频（自动检测语言）
POST http://119.91.206.195:8885/api/asr/recognize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello_world_female2.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./hello_world_female2.wav
